<title>UK: Mill demand for raw cotton is flat in Europe.</title>
<headline>Mill demand for raw cotton is flat in Europe.</headline>
<dateline>LIVERPOOL 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mill demand for raw cotton in Europe registered no improvement despite relatively stable raw material replacement values.</p>
<p>Occasional buying interest was seen in Turkey, Italy and Portugal but elsewhere buyers seemed content to await developments. Eastern Europe saw a similar pattern although a retail nearby business was being discussed in Poland and the Czech and Slovak republics.</p>
</text>
